content.p:
Approves the summary for policymakers of the thematic assessment of the interlinkages among biodiversity, water, food and health (nexus assessment),
IPBES/11/12/Add.1. and accepts the chapters of the assessment, including their executive summaries;
The chapters are made available through a link provided in document IPBES/11/INF/1/Rev.1.

Also approves the summary for policymakers of the thematic assessment of the underlying causes of biodiversity loss and the determinants of transformative change and options for achieving the 2050 Vision for Biodiversity (transformative change assessment),
IPBES/11/12/Add.2. and accepts the chapters of the assessment, including their executive summaries;
The chapters are made available through a link provided in document IPBES/11/INF/2/Rev.1.

Requests the Executive Secretary to update the options set out in the note by the secretariat on work on biodiversity and climate change and collaboration with the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change,
IPBES/8/6. including information on the feasibility and the procedural, financial and time requirements of the suggestions listed in paragraph 14 of the note by the secretariat on engagement with the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change;
IPBES/11/8.
